    type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - You made it up, but the air here is heavier. Your stamina drains <color=orange>faster</color>
    higher up.
  - "You\u2019ll need something to steady your pace. The Magirissa can prepare <color=orange>Briam</color>
    with <color=orange>cabbages and pumpkins</color>. Pull at the <color=orange>silver</color>
    statue to get them\u2014they only come from Fortuna\u2019s grace. "
  - Cook it, eat it, and your stamina will drain at <color=orange>half speed</color>
    for <color=orange>thirty seconds</color>.
  - May Fortuna bless you.
  - You're welcome!
